@RentCar.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7162

### Health check público
GET {{RentCar.API_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login (sustituya las credenciales por las configuradas localmente)
POST {{RentCar.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "admin",
  "password": "<contraseña-local>"
}
